[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3887187188","pull_request_review_id":5058705359,"id":3887187188,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7nscT0","diff_hunk":"@@ -1286,6 +1289,9 @@\n \t\t<member name=\"interface/theme/spacing_preset\" type=\"String\" setter=\"\" getter=\"\">\n \t\t\tThe editor theme spacing preset to use. See also [member interface/theme/base_spacing] and [member interface/theme/additional_spacing].\n \t\t</member>\n+\t\t<member name=\"interface/theme/strip_alpha\" type=\"float\" setter=\"\" getter=\"\">\n+\t\t\tThe opacity to use when drawing row strips and row guides in the editor's [Tree]-based GUIs (such as the Scene tree dock).","path":"doc/classes/EditorSettings.xml","commit_id":"16fafb9a38dcd94d0441f6451873c6a23e56b085","original_commit_id":"16fafb9a38dcd94d0441f6451873c6a23e56b085","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- I am well-aware that it is often referred as the Scene tree dock, but it truly is named \"Scene dock\".\n- I am not sure what \"row guides\" fully entails here. For most intents and purposes it seems to be the same thing as \"row strips\". But please do correct me.\n\n\n```suggestion\n\t\t\tThe opacity to use when drawing striped rows for any interface based on [Tree] in the editor, such as the Scene dock. If set to [code]0.0[/code], no stripes will be drawn. See also [member docks/scene_tree/show_row_stripes].\n```\n\nTangentially related: the name of this setting is a bit misleading. \"Strip\" sounds like a command, as if what the setting does is cut off anything whose alpha passes a certain threshold, for some reason.\n","created_at":"2026-08-29T17:16:37Z","updated_at":"2026-08-29T17:38:04Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111283#discussion_r3887187188","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111283","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3887187188"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111283#discussion_r3887187188"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111283"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3887187188/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":1293,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":15,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3887200448","pull_request_review_id":5058705359,"id":3887200448,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7nsfjA","diff_hunk":"@@ -326,6 +326,9 @@\n \t\t<member name=\"docks/scene_tree/hide_filtered_out_parents\" type=\"bool\" setter=\"\" getter=\"\">\n \t\t\tIf [code]true[/code], the scene tree dock will only show nodes that match the filter, without showing parents that don't. This settings can also be changed in the Scene dock's top menu.\n \t\t</member>\n+\t\t<member name=\"docks/scene_tree/show_row_stripes\